
>> Product := Ikintu gishya.
Product bigeze: ['a'] kora: { :price
	Ibisohoka andika: ['cost ']+ price.
}.
>> Apples := Product gishya.
Ibisohoka andika: ['Apples cost: '].
Apples a 60.
Ibisohoka andika: [' cent a piece.'].


Umubare bigeze: ['X'] kora: { :b
	b × ubwacyo. 
}.
7 X { :i Ibisohoka andika: i. }.
